      "blocks": {
        "88eb7521-5fbd-4422-8909-b536b89798c4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>What is EVA material?</p>",
            "des": "<p>EVA stands for ethylene vinyl acetate — a light, flexible material with water-resistant properties. Because the material is hypoallergenic, the mats give off no odour even at high temperatures.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "dbc7822b-1065-4071-ba4a-4dd0547c956a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>What are the advantages of EVA material in car mats?</p>",
            "des": "<p>EVA has many advantages: wear resistance, durability, light weight, flexibility and shape retention.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "1e9afcfe-c8c1-452a-87d9-a16d1fd3b19f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>What mat sizes are available?</p>",
            "des": "<p>Car mat dimensions differ depending on the car model.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "575491bc-94bb-4c01-a70c-5fbf1197f048": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>What if I need a custom mat?</p>",
            "des": "<p>We can make a separate mat — for example for a gas cylinder that protrudes into the boot — or cover a larger area of the floor in specific places at the customer's request.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "c7bf539b-36fa-4be1-9663-46bfaf0c4cba": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Can the boot mat be made in 2 parts?</p>",
            "des": "<p>Because the product is made to measure, in a 7-seat car we can also split the boot mat into 2 parts, so the third row of seats folds down easily without taking the mat out of the boot.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "3b89d29a-8c60-4a6b-b981-1aba2b1f42c9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>What mat colours are available?</p>",
            "des": "<p>More than 150 colours to choose from. Different mat and edging colours are available, so you stand out among other car owners.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "5aa5b147-4f1f-41b9-aa57-88465558f7f5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>How do I fit EVA mats correctly?</p>",
            "des": "<p>Every set has a specific type of fastening — we have more than 30 types. The fasteners are fitted in the matching places, and we also sew hook-and-loop strips onto the sides so the mats do not slide and stay in place.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "9bcc9929-31c3-4b08-ad69-9a145c857f09": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Can EVA mats be washed?</p>",
            "des": "<p>Yes, the mats can be washed with a soft sponge and detergent. We do not recommend aggressive chemical cleaners.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "eb4517e5-ab48-4945-a66b-d963d5c2fc58": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Can EVA mats be used in winter?</p>",
            "des": "<p>Yes, the mats can be used in winter because they have properties that protect against cold and moisture.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "c3b94ada-1361-4b31-84ef-332a22e6dea6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Do the mats come with a warranty?</p>",
            "des": "<p>We provide a one-year warranty from the date the mats are received, allowing the set to be exchanged for a new one within one year in the event of deformation or detected wear. Thanks to the good quality of the material, the mats last 5–7 years.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        }
      },
